  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8450;</mi></math> be the set of all complex numbers. Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
